"The helper monitors displays and shuts down your Mac when the timeout expires. Installation requires administrator approval. Pause monitoring from the menu whenever needed." = "后台组件监测显示器，并在超时后关机。安装需要管理员授权；可随时从菜单暂停监测。";
"The countdown starts when all displays go offline and cancels when any display reconnects. A display must be detected after startup before monitoring is armed. Pausing, changing settings, or waking from sleep resets the countdown.\n\nWhen monitoring is enabled, the timeout triggers system shutdown. Pause monitoring to disable it. Quitting pauses monitoring; resume it manually when you reopen the app.\n\nUnplugging a display or disconnecting its power also counts as offline. The helper starts at boot; the menu bar app starts at login." = "所有显示器离线后开始计时；重新连接立即取消。开机后需先检测到显示器才会启用计时。暂停、修改设置或睡眠唤醒后重新计时。\n\n监测开启时，超时后会执行系统级关机；可暂停监测以停用自动关机。退出应用会暂停监测；重新打开后需手动恢复。\n\n断电和拔线也会视作离线。后台组件开机运行，菜单栏应用登录启动。";
